@startuml
title UML sequence — Ask for a link (L2-115 criteria 1 to 4)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
actor "Sofía (Youth)" as sofia
box "Frontend — Angular app (account)" #E0F2FE
participant ForgotPasswordPage as page
participant AuthApi as client
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Api" #D1FADF
participant AuthEndpoints as api
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Application" #ECFDF3
participant PasswordResetHandler as handler
end box
box "Infrastructure" #FEF0C7
participant "Database" as db
participant "Email provider" as mail
end box
sofia -> page : Email, Email me a reset link
page -> client : forgotPassword(email)
client -> api : POST /auth/forgot-password
api -> handler : RequestAsync
handler -> db : account and a current membership?
alt no account, deactivated or removed (L2-115 c2)
  handler --> api : nothing sent
else three links already in the last hour (c3)
  handler --> api : nothing sent, nothing stored
else
  handler -> db : store the new link's hash (it replaces earlier links, c4)
  handler -> mail : /reset-password?token=…
end
api --> client : 202 in every case
page -> sofia : Check your email, s••••@harbourview.example
sofia -> page : Resend the email
page -> client : forgotPassword(email)
page -> sofia : toast Sent again
@enduml
